s=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600510/extras/fb4267c382492b70f2a84c3e80c979a1.avif?t=1755849025\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600510/extras_big/fb4267c382492b70f2a84c3e80c979a1.avif?t=1755849025 width=800 height=450 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600510/extras/f480695093d40903d32c43aa6151ccba.avif?t=1755849025\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600510/extras_big/f480695093d40903d32c43aa6151ccba.avif?t=1755849025 width=800 height=450 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600510/extras/4642131d99c70902f116b0edfb25c0ec.avif?t=1755849025\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600510/extras_big/4642131d99c70902f116b0edfb25c0ec.avif?t=1755849025 width=800 height=450 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600510/extras/f4d009b50f1be64c5affa84725665626.avif?t=1755849025\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600510/extras_big/f4d009b50f1be64c5affa84725665626.avif?t=1755849025 width=800 height=450 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600510/extras/6bc84c0ca8850af6639310f6be0407bb.avif?t=1755849025\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600510/extras_big/6bc84c0ca8850af6639310f6be0407bb.avif?t=1755849025 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Last Reunion is an AI-powered deduction game where a joyful reunion ends in tragedy.  </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You play as a police officer investigating a murder that occurred during a house party.  </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore the crime scene from a first-person perspective, interact with objects, and uncover hidden clues.  </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Interrogate NPCs powered by ChatGPT, each designed with a unique personality, backstory, and secrets.  </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your investigation influences the storyline, and each suspect leads to a different ending.  </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Replay the game to discover new evidence and uncover the full truth behind Alan\u2019s death.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>- Immersive first-person investigation gameplay</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>- ChatGPT-integrated NPCs that respond based on unique personas</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>- Interactive crime scene exploration and evidence collection</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>- Multi-ending structure shaped by player choices</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>- Story-driven gameplay set in a single location with dynamic interrogation</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>[Tips for Playing The Last Reunion]</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1\ufe0f\u20e3 Pay close attention to each character\u2019s reaction.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 The more sensitive the response, the more likely your question is tied to the case.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2\ufe0f\u20e3 Gather as much evidence as possible first.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 This will help you build a solid overall picture of the incident.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3\ufe0f\u20e3 Every character will eventually tire.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 The more you interrogate, the more hidden truths will come out.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4\ufe0f\u20e3 Think carefully before asking questions.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 The wrong approach may lead to strange or misleading answers.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5\ufe0f\u20e3 Evidence is more than just an item.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 You need to connect it with other clues when questioning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc49 Experience it yourself now in *The Last Reunion*!</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Too Late to Save","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3600510/d21c0dace79e1b5f3e36e59f1f97a7a584a89a5b.jpg"},{"name":"The One Who Fulfilled Her Grief","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3600510/993ade727ba4d4872f39fca9d879672924fd4e42.jpg"},{"name":"Together at the End","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3600510/a6a00dc7c4f282bacf7eb24a3e5dc1511e8a7fc8.jpg"}],"total":3},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3600510?t=1755849025","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3600510?t=1755849025","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600510/43f81ae71fe8898b010ba84aac525e31c17fac64/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755849025","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600510/43f81ae71fe8898b010ba84aac525e31c17fac64/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1755849025","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"This game is a mystery inve