5\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600510/extras_big/6bc84c0ca8850af6639310f6be0407bb.avif?t=1755849025 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Last Reunion is an AI-powered deduction game where a joyful reunion ends in tragedy.  </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You play as a police officer investigating a murder that occurred during a house party.  </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore the crime scene from a first-person perspective, interact with objects, and uncover hidden clues.  </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Interrogate NPCs powered by ChatGPT, each designed with a unique personality, backstory, and secrets.  </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your investigation influences the storyline, and each suspect leads to a different ending.  </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Replay the game to discover new evidence and uncover the full truth behind Alan\u2019s death.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>- Immersive first-person investigation gameplay</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>- ChatGPT-integrated NPCs that respond based on unique personas</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>- Interactive crime scene exploration and evidence collection</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>- Multi-ending structure shaped by player choices</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>- Story-driven gameplay set in a single location with dynamic interrogation</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>[Tips for Playing The Last Reunion]</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1\ufe0f\u20e3 Pay close attention to each character\u2019s reaction.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 The more sensitive the response, the more likely your question is tied to the case.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2\ufe0f\u20e3 Gather as much evidence as possible first.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 This will help you build a solid overall picture of the incident.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3\ufe0f\u20e3 Every character will eventually tire.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 The more you interrogate, the more hidden truths will come out.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4\ufe0f\u20e3 Think carefully before asking questions.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 The wrong approach may lead to strange or misleading answers.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5\ufe0f\u20e3 Evidence is more than just an item.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 You need to connect it with other clues when questioning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc49 Experience it yourself now in *The Last Reunion*!</p>","developers":["\uc81c\uc774\uac8c\uc784\uc988"],"genres":[{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600510/94452e351e237d8ee40d3945849c7dccd13adcfd/header.jpg?t=1755849025","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3600510/723353845/da4f583670d89c421d70564d6c230ded483d7c24/1755748805/dash_av1.mpd?t=1755847876","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3600510/723353845/da4f583670d89c421d70564d6c230ded483d7c24/1755748805/dash_h264.mpd?t=1755847876","highligh